  "title": "Chef John's Root Vegetable Gratin",
  "description": "If you've ever had a craving for a dish with turnips, rutabagas, celery root, potatoes, and parsnips all-in-one, this cheesy and creamy vegetable gratin recipe is just what you're after.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-10-10T00:50:43-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2024-12-05T18:28:59-05:00",
